{"id":290,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深切缅怀革命先烈的丰功伟绩，传承红色基因，4 月 3 日，化学与化工学院党委组织师生党员前往牛驼寨烈士陵园，举行“缅怀革命先烈，赓续红色血脉”清明祭扫主题党日活动，学院党委副书记蔡文涛及师生党员代表50余人参与了本次活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KM8lOsnRGDnllsUx8-bnm9Znz7PUmMJ2nzN4ol-boRWkMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yZokhVoSyZLzNin7LaU4LPL77sLlr2L4lPo778U4v4UlWFU87YUNMkL7QFMRARnmLJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MRGPgtA8pU0cc&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B88E98195DC0C310A71EF3518A4C73AB/CA2BCB0F/48CF3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KolCODnzLPL7Q2UxzN8UzAfM4WknzAJRU4NiL7lDMlUbnRL0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZLYhfUSybUm-aozlZUl7DUlCiL8Q2nN78o7MVMNUinlnFMznRM4GDMRAFUmTfLzlJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MRGPgtA8pU0cc&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\"></p><p>在巍峨的革命烈士纪念碑前，学生代表郑重敬献花篮，蔡文涛缓步上前悉心整理缎带，全体人员肃立注目、深深鞠躬，以最崇高的敬意，告慰为国家独立、民族解放、人民幸福英勇献身的革命先烈。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUN-OPo7r2L7M2nxlLYo7-PL7M2MzQJVMmvanR-YMRC8nz70gihFp2hmCIa0LShfU1hkn1ysU47snz67nzGZLm9bLmUboRVRUllDUlnVLlQFLzG8U49bMmWFoRWkMzvJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MRGPgtA8pU0cc&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1ABBF7C17E7DE0828924981CAE6ADE1F/104C8962/82B57\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KL4VOkUmG8oRQknxzlbLRGsL4n7nzWJ2M4M2M4V2Ll78Lz90gihFp2hmCIa0okhRLkybLkh7M467MNCPLNn7nR98LNCPolLaU87PLRLbnmnFU8l8LzWRo7rFLz-4Lz98gjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UaLSbw6208c&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KLz-O4L4-bMz7aox7n2nmUaLN78MmNJYLzLbLlLZoz9sLl70gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7UShkn1yPnmW7LzT7ol-inmvsL8nVnNLaU4GiU8QfU4MFLmNsLzL8UzVFLzAfLzVfgjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UaLSbw6208c&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1DABF1F2D19D9B5F773DEFC0C05CFAC3/297134A1/18A11A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 350px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KnNCOYUm7bL7rRMxlL4UzCaUlLYLzGJbU4nkUmnkMRC8nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkMky4M1y8Lmn2L4C8nm-8MznRLN-YMRAkLlVVMmU4nNnFLzMkLlnknNrFnzNao7-8gjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UaLSbw6208c&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\"></p><p>默哀环节，全体师生低头静立、静默致哀，三分钟的肃穆无声，承载着对英烈的深切缅怀与无限追思，寄托着对革命先辈的崇高敬意。随后，全体师生齐声朗诵《向先烈报告》，字字饱含深情，句句彰显担当，许下传承英烈精神、勇担时代使命的庄严承诺。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KLNrOVM4UZMNVfUxllDnmMfM7-ZMNMJRMRGaoz-YL8-aL8U0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2U1yankybLzQfozlZnR9bMm6fUmvinz7bMzUiUzM2UlrFMmQknR9Yn7QFM8LiM7lJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MRGPgtA8pU0cc&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5FB0D916A958D8967AB75E19545A3FAE/66BD82DF/7C54E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KM7VO7LNLbozlinxNUiLlM7MR-Yn7MJkLm-PUmMRozliMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8nShfn1y4MRTfL4-aUNLbMz62MRUZMNlaMzWkM4v4U4TFMzCPMm9iLRWFLz78LzLbgjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UaLSbw6208c&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\"></p><p>在革命纪念馆内，大家跟随讲解员的脚步，驻足凝视历史图片、珍贵文物，重温峥嵘岁月，感悟革命先辈坚定信仰、浴血奋战的崇高精神，接受了一场深刻的红色洗礼。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUmLOaoR-DL4N4LxRGZMRvaUzWVLz7JDozvDMRQRnRA7nzN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYybokhfM1hkU4VfMlW2nRr2LRUYLzLYLmC8LzT7nNr7LNWFoz9ZoR6fM4QFM4WVU4GJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MRGPgtA8pU0cc&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C98A6BC1A5BFD5F04213226419DFED2B/98887A76/72EC0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KLmUOiMz6fUN7bnxN-4MzT7LmNaM4NJYnmNZU8Csol-Ynll0gihFp2hmCIa0USy4MYhVUSysL77PU8M7LmNinln7LN-YM46RnRWfozNsM4AFnzN8Mzv4LNnFLzG8UmCZgjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8oSyPL4UaLSbw6208c&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png\"></p><p>此次活动，既是一次深刻的爱国主义教育，也是一次生动的精神传承实践。师生们纷纷表示，将以革命先烈为精神标杆，铭记历史、珍爱和平，把缅怀之情转化为学习与工作的不竭动力，以实际行动赓续红色血脉、传承奋斗精神，努力为学院高质量发展贡献自己的力量。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hgxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KM8lOsnRGDnllsUx8-bnm9Znz7PUmMJ2nzN4ol-boRWkMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yZokhVoSyZLzNin7LaU4LPL77sLlr2L4lPo778U4v4UlWFU87YUNMkL7QFMRARnmLJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg474MRGPgtA8pU0cc&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=13401&e=.png"}